          %p
            See at
            %em
              %a{:href => "Cartan+connection#ExampleGStructures"} Cartan connection – Examples – G-structures
          %h3#in_higher_differential_geometry In higher differential geometry
          %h4#structure_on_a_principal_bundle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
              %semantics
                %mrow
